    "title": "Children's book about Buddy the Beefalo now available - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Plymouth\nChildren's book about Buddy the Beefalo now available\n2 hours ago\nGAINESVILLE, Fla. — The story of Buddy the Beefalo, who escaped a slaughterhouse and evaded capture for months in Plymouth, Conn., is now featured in a new children's book. Buddy, who is a hybrid of a bison and a domestic cow, currently resides at Critter Creek Farm Sanctuary, a nonprofit farm animal sanctuary in Gainsville, Fla. In May, Critter Creek announced that Buddy was adopted through the sanctuary's sponsorship program.\n1",
